OL,3,AMet was negligent and reckless, sisters
OL,4,Aof 'Putney pusher' suspect tell BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis sisters Alexia Hicks and Sophie
OL,7,FVolker told BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,8,Fprogramme his mental health was
OL,9,Fdeteriorating and that "every day was
OL,10,Fbecoming difficult" for him in recent
OL,11,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
