OL,3,A'This is our company': Nigerians show
OL,4,Aoff oil wealth after share-buying
OL,5,Afrenzy
OL,6,
OL,7,FEvery Nigerian is now an oil magnate.
OL,9,FAt least that is what the social media
OL,10,Fmemes would have you believe as
OL,11,Finvestor fever hits the country.
OL,13,FNigerians have been eager to have a
OL,14,Fpiece of the energy business that was
OL,15,Fbuilt up by the country's ` and
OL,16,Fcontinent's ` richest man: Aliko
OL,17,FDangote.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
